2. Atelier801 images
--------------------

The following images belong to Atelier801 and remain its property. They are
used here for non-commercial purposes, with credit, and are not covered by the
MIT License above:

  - public/img/sections/*.png   (section icons)
  - public/img/flags/*.png      (community flags)
