All rights reserved by Atelier801. If you reuse this project, you are
responsible for obtaining the right to use these images, or for replacing them
(section icons can be changed from Admin > Sections).

Atelier801 can ask for these images to be removed at any time, and they will
be removed.


3. Inspiration
--------------

Parts of this application (layout, navigation, look and feel, section
organisation and some features) are inspired by the old Flash forum used in
Atelier801's services during the years 2010-2015. Forum801 is an independent
rewrite: none of the original source code is used.

The Forum801 logo (public/img/logo.png, generated by resources/logo/generate.py)
is an original creation inspired by the style of Atelier801's logos.

Atelier801 and the names of its services are trademarks of their respective
owners. They are mentioned for identification and credit only.


4. Other third-party assets
---------------------------

  - DejaVu Sans Bold (resources/fonts/DejaVuSans-Bold.ttf), used by the
    captcha: DejaVu Fonts License, see resources/fonts/DejaVu-LICENSE.txt.
  - Fredoka (resources/logo/Fredoka.ttf), used to draw the logo: SIL Open Font
    License 1.1, see resources/logo/OFL.txt.
  - Interface icons (public/img/icons/*.svg) are original, generated by
    resources/icons/generate.py, and covered by the MIT License above.
  - PHP and JavaScript dependencies (Laravel, Livewire, Alpine.js and others)
    are installed through Composer/npm and keep their own licenses.
